WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,940
Chongqing was also covered by Leng Yue behind Hulong Tui Road.

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,820
But it's coming from all directions.

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,740
Quantity ratio

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,820
Half, more than twice as much

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,340
The fleet's damage has exceeded 40%

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,260
I won’t leave until I can get down the irrigation tower today.

7
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,860
Even the ship back to report the news is gone.

8
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,240
The whole fleet obeys the order

9
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,320
Give up the tower attack

10
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,240
The rear team changes to the front team

11
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,240
After the White Tiger Camp is broken

12
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,720
Evacuate to the landing point below Tenla

13
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,760
Rebuilding ground defenses

14
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,920
Leave it to me after the break

15
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,640
I will definitely save you

16
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,620
Zhongtian North

17
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:53,890
Switching to autonomous driving and reporting the line of defense does not belong to Nie Ling

18
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:55,210
Her Majesty the Queen

19
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:57,210
You sent it yourself

20
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,180
This human spiritual barrier

21
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:00,500
I can't even penetrate you

22
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:01,900
It's rare

23
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,740
So I give this human being to you

24
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:04,980
See if you can

25
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,340
Nerve reflexes are very active

26
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,780
Physique far beyond that of ordinary humans

27
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:10,100
It’s really good to have a foundation that can withstand the torture you face in the field.

28
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,580
But the mental barrier is too tight

29
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:13,820
Even my soul-knowing needle can't penetrate, so there's no need to probe.

30
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:16,260
Tuck Zegolis in and let him come

31
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:17,780
There is only one recombinant embryo

32
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,860
Are you sure you want to use it on this human?

33
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:21,940
That old guy slept with a dozen accountants

34
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:23,100
It's time to wake up

35
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:24,460
Wait until he knows the new body

36
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:25,740
Lost humble human beings

37
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,100
Look at his expression

38
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:28,220
It's not like he always looked down upon

39
00:01:28,220 --> 00:01:31,140
Are you half-weight? Are you following orders?

40
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:42,710
Recombinant gene training detected

41
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:44,630
Code name Zegolis
